<title>9 · The Cassandra syndrome — Sixty Years Later</title>
<meta name="description" content="Lem's own translator says he should not be read as a futurologist, and that scoring him is a category error. This book has eighty-five rows of evidence on the question. Most of it agrees with him — and one part of it does not.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../static/style.css">
<script src="../static/theme.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="../index.html">Sixty Years <span>Later</span></a>
    <nav class="site-nav">
