checks/claims-2026.tsv:119:0	summa-editions	Summa Technologiae was first published in Polish in 1964 and reissued that year, with altered editions in 1967 and 1974; Zylinska's English translation (Minnesota, 2013) follows the fourth edition of 1974, which Lem corrected and updated partly on reader feedback. Lem's essays "Twenty Years Later" (1982, appended to the fourth Polish edition) and "Thirty Years Later" are not included in this English edition	Joanna Zylinska, translator's introduction to Summa Technologiae (University of Minnesota Press, 2013), pp. 20-21, citing Butko; table of contents of the 2013 edition (Translator's Introduction, chs. 1-8, Conclusion, Notes, Bibliography, Index)	checked-by:claude:2026-08-18
