drafts/reviews/07-agy.r1.md:45:   - **Location:** Prose and Ledger row 8, `EARLY: Competence grown from written language, now acting through tools... <!-- CHECK: gpt3-2020 -->`
drafts/reviews/07-agy.r1.md:46:   - **Problem:** The essay uses `gpt3-2020` as the receipt for a model "acting through tools" and running "search loops". GPT-3 in 2020 was a text-completion model that did not use tools or run search loops (those capabilities belong to models from 2023–2024). The receipt is historically mismatched to the claim.
