drafts/reviews/02-codex.err:674:<p>The car was replaced, and not by what he said. Air-cushion vehicles did not take the roads or anything else: the car-carrying cross-Channel service closed on 1 October 2000, beaten by a tunnel, and large commercial hovercraft effectively vanished, leaving one short scheduled route as a curiosity. <!-- CHECK: hovercraft-2000 --> Wheel drive survives untouched. What is displacing the internal combustion engine is a different motor under the same wheels: electric cars reached a quarter of global new-car sales in 2025, and more than half in China. <!-- CHECK: ev-share-2025 --></p>
