11-ABSTRACT
12-
13:The central question of the article is should Stanisław Lem be read as a futurologist? The main thesis is that more than in predicting the future Lem always has been
14-more interested in exploration the conceptual limits of science and its technological
15-offshoots.
16-Keywords: Stanisław Lem, Hugo Gernsbacher, Herbert George Wells, futurology, conceptual limits of science.
