+## Minimum revision set
+
+1. Correct the Swirski attribution and remove the motive HIT.
+2. Rebuild or formally reauthorize the meta-ledger; remove the false object/problem headings.
+3. Replace the straw-man unfalsifiability row with Swirski's actual claim.
+4. Remove the p. 43 specialisation “forecast” and recompute essay 2 plus the book census.
+5. Split the ariadnology claims and preserve essay 7's MISS/OPEN distinction.
+6. Test Swirski's and Butko's VR, SETI, and search-engine credits against essays 3, 6, and 7.
+7. Correct the OPEN-layer arithmetic, “nobody translated,” unsupported independence, and unsupported expertise superlative.
+8. Regenerate every Lem and secondary quotation row from the final HTML, add semantically correct claim receipts, and rerun `./verify.sh`.

